When the set changes nothing, stdout stays empty and the success summary still goes to
stderr.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# My Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=backlog
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=backlog
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# My Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
